# 8. Problem Cards

Each card should display:

- Problem title.
- Short description.
- City.
- Category.
- Anonymous username.
- Relative timestamp.
- Upvote count.
- Comment count.
- Open or Resolved badge.
- Optional image thumbnail.

### Example

**Civic · Anantapur**

**Why is garbage collection irregular in our area?**

"Garbage has not been collected regularly in our neighborhood for several days. Has anyone found the right department to contact?"

`Anonymous user · 2 hours ago`

`↑ 24` · `8 comments`

`Open`

Use realistic spacing and a clear content hierarchy.

The title should receive the most visual emphasis. Keep metadata and actions compact.

Every card must have clear interaction boundaries so clicking an upvote or share button does not accidentally open the entire post.

