# 11. Resolution System

The MVP should support two statuses.

### Open
The problem still needs help.

### Resolved
The author has indicated that the problem has been resolved.

Rules:
- Authors can mark their own posts as resolved.
- Authors can reopen posts if necessary.
- Other users cannot change the status.
- Resolved posts remain readable.
- Admins can remove content when required for moderation or privacy reasons.

Display a green Resolved badge with a checkmark.

Do not implement complex community verification in the first version.

