# 18. Performance and Reliability

The MVP should remain lightweight.

Requirements:
- Paginate the feed.
- Start with 10–20 posts per request.
- Load images only when needed.
- Compress uploaded images where appropriate.
- Add indexes for commonly queried fields.
- Avoid unnecessary background polling.
- Use clear loading and error states.
- Avoid fetching private account information for public feeds.
- Avoid unnecessary animation libraries.

Ensure the platform remains usable on slower mobile connections.

Do not promise a specific loading time until it has been measured in the deployed application.

