# 19. Free-Plan Constraints

Build the MVP to minimize unnecessary use of Lovable credits and backend resources.

## Development Rules

- Use a small number of dependencies.
- Reuse components.
- Avoid rewriting working code.
- Work on one major feature at a time.
- Avoid complex AI agents.
- Use mock data only during initial UI development.
- Connect the real database once the basic interface works.
- Keep AI moderation configurable.
- Avoid unnecessary external APIs.
- Monitor database, image storage, bandwidth, and API usage.

Remember that Lovable's development plan and the application's production infrastructure have separate usage limits.

Before launch, verify the current free-plan restrictions for Lovable, Supabase, and any hosting or AI provider you choose.

The application must display honest errors if a service limit is reached rather than pretending that operations succeeded.

